  "description": "The era of the Tower has suddenly begun. Kang Ji-heon, who barely made a living running a food truck, ends up offering \"Kimchi Bowl Noodles\" to gods from beyond a dimension whom he met by chance in an open chat room. What kind of taste is this?! Captivated by this never-before-seen sensation, the gods launch a gift-giving offensive for even tastier offerings! An endless K-food feast provided by the awakened \"Honey Taste Food Truck\" Kang Ji-heon!\n\n*He makes a fortune, too.\n\n(Source: Naver, Translated)",
